  "description": {
   "en": "Maiko Yamakage, who is looking for a boyfriend and a job, meets the dark and dull Aya Masuyama on a matching app.\nAs she talks with him, she senses his potential as a streamer and proposes to him that he show his face and stream his videos....\nThis is a story of a positive woman and a negative man, and the growth of a streamer!\n\n(Source: Kuragebunch, edited)",
   "ja": "絶賛彼氏\u0026仕事募集中の山影米子（やまかげまいこ）はマッチングアプリで 暗くて冴えない増山操（ますやまあや）に出会う。\n話をするうち、動画配信者としてのポテンシャルを感じて操に顔出し配信を提案するが…。\nポジティブ女とネガティブ男が織りなす、配信者成長物語!!"
  },
